{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22193","headline":"江州雪 · 白居易","name":"江州雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新雪满前山，初晴好天气。\n日西骑马出，忽有京都意。\n城柳方缀花，檐冰才结穗。\n须臾风日暖，处处皆飘坠。\n行吟赏未足，坐叹销何易。\n犹胜岭南看，雰雰不到地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}